        <skos:altLabel>Mm³</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Local unit: QUDT has no unit for 10^6 m³. Printed as 'Mm3' or 'Mm³' in the bulletins; the unambiguous symbol is hm³ (in SI notation Mm³ would mean cubic megametre). Conversion multiplier to the SI unit given with a Julian year (365.25 d) where a year is involved.</skos:definition>
      </qudt:Unit>
