        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://www.opengis.net/def/waterml/2.0/interpolationType/TotalPrec"/>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An amount (inflow, release, withdrawal, transfer, evaporation, rain) accumulated over the reporting day D-1, which ends at the reading of day D. The Page 1 header 'du D-1 observée le D' prints this day.</skos:definition>
