        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">before 2024-01-09: 3314/3323; from 2024-01-09: 638/638</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:note xml:lang="en">The national comparator has the same temporal support as its Page 1 per-dam counterpart.</skos:note>
