    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">réservoir (ouvrage géré)</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A reservoir as a managed storage facility listed in the bulletin roster: its basin, its capacities, its sedimentation and its operation. It stores exactly one reservoir water body and is created by one dam.</skos:definition>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Capacities, sedimentation, normal pool level and reported operations are properties of the managed reservoir, not of the water body at a given moment.</skos:scopeNote>
